-- John Keats
@To have great poets, there must be great audiences.
-- Walt Whitman
@For man is by nature an artist.
-- Tagore
@The only lasting beauty is the beauty of the heart.
-- Rumi
@To believe that what has not occurred in history will not occur at all,
